Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.39,0:00:01.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉　那件事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然倉促了些
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.06,0:00:09.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,儀式就安排在同盟條約簽訂的同一天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.24,0:00:11.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可以 稍等一下 尤拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.79,0:00:12.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我還沒…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.61,0:00:20.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會是哪邊的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.53,0:00:24.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她和孩子們拜託你了　去避難所
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:26.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.17,0:00:30.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快穿好衣服　有不速之客
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.78,0:00:32.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和拉米亞斯艦長一起照顧好拉克絲他們
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.32,0:00:33.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.52,0:00:45.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.77,0:00:52.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是協調者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.35,0:00:57.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們剛才的目標…是我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.87,0:01:09.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲　你帶著鑰匙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.27,0:01:15.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.25,0:01:20.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我去開門好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.39,0:01:23.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不　但這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.61,0:01:26.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去　連你們都無法保護
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.95,0:01:30.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣會更令我痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.26,0:01:32.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.25,0:01:40.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.60,0:01:46.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那難道是…Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.26,0:02:11.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,儚く散った光が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らを今呼び覚ます
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しみは音を立て
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,消えるあの場所から
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,深く愛する
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,勇氣と希望強く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,感じるこの記憶が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絡み合う心と
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ココロをつないで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,動き出している
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,輝く光が照らし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らを今呼び起こす
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,響きあう音を立て
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,刻むこの場所から
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,永久に信じ続けて…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PHASE-14　往明日的啟航
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.01,0:03:55.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,房子又壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.17,0:03:57.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的房間是在哪裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.03,0:04:00.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,危險　不能去那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.90,0:04:02.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Ash？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.29,0:04:04.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯　雖然只看過資料
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.63,0:04:08.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但那是最近剛量產的機種
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.30,0:04:12.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,應該還只有正規軍配備才對
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.33,0:04:15.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們來針對拉克絲　就表示…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.29,0:04:20.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然還不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:25.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,往PLANT的搬家計劃先緩緩較好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.31,0:04:35.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但為什麼是我？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.40,0:04:46.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪娜小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:47.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉大人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.44,0:04:52.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.97,0:04:57.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐讓我轉交給基拉大人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.23,0:05:04.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,小姐自己已經無法親自來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.03,0:05:07.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以讓我偷偷帶來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.42,0:05:12.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.36,0:05:14.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,受傷了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.68,0:05:17.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不　身體很好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.73,0:05:24.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過為了準備婚禮被關進了賽蘭家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.37,0:05:29.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,儀式舉行前都住在他們府裡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.46,0:05:34.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那之後怎麼樣了我瑪娜也無法得知
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:42.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然和尤拉大人的關係是從小就定好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.49,0:05:48.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只要卡嘉莉小姐高興瑪娜也想從心中祝福他們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.10,0:05:52.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是賽蘭家的做法太過分了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.52,0:05:58.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我們這邊長輩都不在就處處隻手遮天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.95,0:06:00.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:05.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本打算親口告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.23,0:06:08.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰知道現在身不由己
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:15.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布加盟世界安全保證機構的事該知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.03,0:06:21.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而我為迎接和尤拉 羅馬的結婚典禮　身在賽蘭家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.39,0:06:26.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然突然了些　但現在的情勢下也別無他法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.16,0:06:34.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在國家確實需要出色並值得信賴的領導者和體制
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.71,0:06:42.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖不知今後奧布會在世界形勢中扮演什麼角色
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.76,0:06:44.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但無論多微不足道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:48.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我都必須盡奧布首相的一份職責
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.00,0:06:52.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我會和尤拉 羅馬結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.76,0:06:57.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夾帶的戒指是阿斯蘭給的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:07:00.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒法再帶在身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.90,0:07:02.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,更不希望被人搶走
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.43,0:07:07.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但我也沒法下決心扔掉它
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.51,0:07:11.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.00,0:07:15.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他回來後能不能替我還給他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.38,0:07:19.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒能好好說明就做出這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.72,0:07:21.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其實我也不願意
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.81,0:07:24.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了　抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.90,0:07:29.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為讓大家有個能和平幸福生活的國家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.68,0:07:30.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也會努力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.36,0:07:32.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:15.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,女人？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.33,0:08:28.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.37,0:08:32.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起　但那東西又會去攻擊地球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.11,0:08:36.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又會殺許多地球上的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.29,0:08:38.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼就開槍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.43,0:08:41.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,坐上那機體扣板機的人就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.32,0:08:44.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.05,0:08:57.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫卡嘉莉　你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.31,0:09:00.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:04.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是敵人　現在的那傢伙已經…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:07.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那只有打倒他不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.61,0:09:10.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:12.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼會變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.81,0:09:15.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼非這麼做不可
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:17.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他殺了尼高爾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.77,0:09:20.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個喜歡鋼琴、還只有15歲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.50,0:09:23.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但也為保護PLANT而戰的他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.08,0:09:26.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉也不過是為保護某些東西而戰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.14,0:09:29.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼非得被殺不可
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.57,0:09:32.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且還是被你這個朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:42.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因被殺而去殺人　因殺人而又被殺
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:45.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣最後真的能得到和平嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:55.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,時間到了　卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:25.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天真美　卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.67,0:10:26.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,光彩耀人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.05,0:10:30.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過頭髮有些掃興
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.39,0:10:35.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,留一下吧　我比較喜歡那樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.07,0:10:46.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喝些什麼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.24,0:10:48.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,很緊張嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.85,0:10:52.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才開始都不理睬我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.75,0:10:54.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不　沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.22,0:10:56.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:11:02.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,該是「不　沒關係的　請不必操心」吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.88,0:11:05.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,得有點樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.66,0:11:11.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看　新聞媒體都看著
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.70,0:11:13.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,表現得高興些
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.06,0:11:19.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這樣真的好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.30,0:11:23.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯　再說也別無選擇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.71,0:11:34.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原本我們就還未弄清什麼是正確的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.08,0:11:38.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但放棄的話就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.41,0:11:48.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也不能明明知道卻默不做聲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:55.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣做的結果我們很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.38,0:11:59.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以非走不可了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.85,0:12:02.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在再次變成那樣之前
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.72,0:12:34.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.32,0:12:50.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.61,0:12:58.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無論如何都要將世界一分為二嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.15,0:13:00.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大西洋聯邦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.56,0:13:02.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非敵既友
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.27,0:13:06.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而奧布就拋棄其理念與法律
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.60,0:13:10.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奉命與被強加的敵人戰鬥嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.57,0:13:19.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你要磨蹭到什麼時候 還不快走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.35,0:13:23.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我的家人都是被阿斯哈所殺
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.44,0:13:25.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們有我們的責任
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.60,0:13:27.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你有你的責任
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.22,0:13:31.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒人繼承意志的話一切都完了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.03,0:13:33.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.65,0:13:38.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼都不懂的傢伙 不要說得好像自己什麼都明白一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.15,0:13:48.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,作為你的父親很幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.13,0:13:51.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能遇見卡嘉莉太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.67,0:13:56.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你有我來保護
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.72,0:14:15.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那些眼淚當然是高興的眼淚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.39,0:14:21.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎低功率啟動中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:24.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,導管以及APU啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:26.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能量傳輸正常
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.13,0:14:32.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 外裝緩沖裝置30%輸出
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:36.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,氣密以及水密隔板確認全部關閉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.48,0:14:40.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,生命維持裝置正常運轉中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:42.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個　巴爾特菲路特隊長？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.17,0:14:47.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不如還是坐這個位子吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.69,0:14:51.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不了　這艘船原本就人手不足
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.77,0:14:54.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,根據情況我也得出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.27,0:14:59.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那裡還是你的座位　拉米亞斯艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.52,0:15:06.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主動力接通
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.06,0:15:08.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,系統一切正常
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.79,0:15:10.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Archangel全站點啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.59,0:15:14.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起　母親　又要…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.30,0:15:16.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.55,0:15:20.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但有件事別忘記
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.54,0:15:23.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你的家在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.18,0:15:28.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直都在這裡並且愛著你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.75,0:15:30.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,母親
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.93,0:15:34.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以一定要回來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.60,0:15:36.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.53,0:15:39.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始注水
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.78,0:15:43.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確認疊層裝甲全部通電
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.41,0:15:45.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,融除膠噴嘴壓力正常
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.09,0:15:48.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確認APU導管分離
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.47,0:15:51.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,150
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.47,0:15:53.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,181
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.69,0:16:02.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,常壓30　FCS以及全兵器庫、浮游器啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.34,0:16:08.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,最大值
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.28,0:16:09.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主閘門打開
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.02,0:16:11.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主閘門打開
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:14.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拘束機械臂解除
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.47,0:16:19.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎20%　微速前進
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.64,0:16:23.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎20%　微速前進
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.16,0:16:43.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,離開水路後上升角30　引擎最大
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.03,0:16:59.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各部門檢查完畢　全站點正常
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.54,0:17:02.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離到達海面10秒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.24,0:17:03.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在最大推進力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.65,0:17:12.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,離水　Archangel出動
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.87,0:17:39.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然你一向讓人放心還是小心為好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.57,0:17:40.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.28,0:17:43.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,班長
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.93,0:17:46.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今天在此進行婚禮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.91,0:17:49.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,並得到哈烏玫亞神的允許
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.60,0:17:52.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,步入此祭壇的人是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.73,0:17:56.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉 羅馬 賽蘭和卡嘉莉 尤拉 阿斯哈嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.98,0:17:57.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.19,0:18:00.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom出擊 準備完成
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.19,0:18:03.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 大和　Freedom出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.03,0:18:09.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,未知物體接近中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.47,0:18:10.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,未知物體接近中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.97,0:18:11.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,緊急警報
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.12,0:18:14.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第2護衛艦群　出航準備
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.24,0:18:22.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,未知?　這是Archangel吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.37,0:18:24.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯　還有Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.72,0:18:29.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從心中盼望舉行這次婚禮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.17,0:18:32.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,並發誓不變的愛與忠誠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.24,0:18:37.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哈烏玫亞一定會傾聽你們的願望
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:40.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在再次提問
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.28,0:18:44.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,兩位心中的誓言沒有虛假吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.46,0:18:46.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.67,0:18:51.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不行　軍部來不及追擊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.89,0:18:52.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快避難
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.49,0:18:54.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.44,0:18:55.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.25,0:18:56.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保護卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.19,0:18:56.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迎擊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.49,0:19:04.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.51,0:19:05.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.65,0:19:25.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,做什麼？基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.93,0:19:32.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在搞什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.45,0:19:34.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快開炮　笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.57,0:19:36.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉她　卡嘉莉她
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.72,0:19:39.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但魯莽開槍會擊中卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.20,0:20:02.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,放我下來　傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.56,0:20:03.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂　基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.83,0:20:09.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉　抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.57,0:20:13.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.34,0:20:19.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這禮服還真華麗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.60,0:20:20.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.64,0:20:22.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,安靜一下　抓牢了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.23,0:20:27.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是奧布軍總部　Freedom請立刻著陸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:29.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom請立刻著陸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.26,0:20:31.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.71,0:20:41.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,4點方向MS　是Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.36,0:20:46.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總部來電　Freedom從會場綁架卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.67,0:20:48.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要求謹慎處置
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.55,0:20:49.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:50.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.65,0:20:51.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.08,0:20:53.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,停止射擊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:20:58.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Archangel
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.64,0:21:00.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,包圍後施加壓力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:04.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以卡嘉莉小姐的生命安全第一
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.97,0:21:09.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom收容完成
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.94,0:21:11.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉也安全無恙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.82,0:21:13.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幹得好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:16.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那出發吧　艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:20.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開閥門　Archangel緊急下潛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.77,0:21:27.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,特達戛上校　Archangel開始下潛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.35,0:21:30.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣會讓他們逃走　請下令攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.56,0:21:36.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是要求謹慎處置嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.04,0:21:51.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓他們逃了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.20,0:21:53.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.08,0:21:56.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,護衛艦群在搞什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.93,0:21:58.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了 Archangel
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.21,0:22:01.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐和這世界的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,涙で滲んだ  この時空を  見上げるたび
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,儚い蒼さが  胸を締めつけてく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,運命なら  哀しみの果てまで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戦い続けた  日々を跡に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Life Goes On　燃え上がる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,命がある限り
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真実の自分さえ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見失いそう　それでも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Life Goes On　守りたくて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,心は砕かれて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本当の哀しみを知った瞳は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,愛に溢れて....
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.86,0:23:25.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,認為是正確的需要的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.47,0:23:27.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在所知的全部中選擇的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.34,0:23:32.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但時間的指針如同嘲笑他們一樣繼續前行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.65,0:23:36.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,未來的真面目到底在何方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.85,0:23:40.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無暇猶豫　所有航船向新的大海進發
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.60,0:23:44.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下回　機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.87,0:23:46.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,重返戰場
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.78,0:23:49.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向新的世界馳騁吧　Saviour
